T*
(A domain is the tenant. Campaigns come after skills, users, lists, dispositions, and a) Tj
T*
(profile. A contact center is not a phone system A PBX connects extensions. A contact center) Tj
T*
(adds queues, skills, lists, dispositions, and reports around those calls. Five9 Virtual) Tj
T*
(Contact Center is that layer, hosted as a domain rather than as servers you rack. The domain) Tj
T*
(is the tenant You sign into one domain. Skill groups, users, lists, prompts, scripts, and) Tj
T*
(campaigns live there. Another domain does not inherit them. Roles on the floor The same) Tj
T*
(person is not every role. Agents take contacts. Supervisors can sit in skill groups with) Tj
T*
(agents. Administrators configure the domain. Reporting is its own permission: standard) Tj
T*
(reports do not appear without the Reporting role and at least one reporting permission.) Tj
T*
(Three campaign types Public admin topics describe three campaign types: inbound, outbound,) Tj
T*
(and autodial. Inbound answers a DNIS and runs the campaign IVR. Outbound uses the dialer and) Tj
T*
(an agent. Autodial also dials a list, and the planning topic groups it with inbound when you) Tj
T*
(add prompts and IVR. Contacts, fields, and lists A contact record is a row of fields.) Tj
T*
(number1, number2, and number3 are the usual phone slots the dialer walks. Lists are sets of) Tj
T*
(those rows attached to outbound and autodial campaigns. Dispositions are the dialer&#x27;s) Tj
T*
(memory A disposition is the outcome stored on a record. System dispositions and custom) Tj
T*
(dispositions both exist. The disposition topic says many system dispositions are redialed) Tj
T*
(five times if you leave the default redial count, and you can reset that count. One profile,) Tj
T*
(many campaigns A campaign profile overrides campaign defaults such as the ANI. You may) Tj
T*
(create many profiles. A campaign uses one profile at a time. The same profile can be on more) Tj
T*
(than one campaign. You attach it in Advanced mode, and workflow rules can swap it.) Tj
